no-circular  (forbidden, error)
  Files may not be part of an import cycle.
  why: A cycle makes the order of initialisation an accident.
  fix: Move what both modules need into a third module both import.
  from: {}
  to: {"circular":true}
  matches: from 10 modules, to 0; 1 violations
  first edges:
    src/order/discount.ts -> src/order/order.ts
